e PR title.\n\n4. **P4 — dead helper:** **Measured:** `scan_loop_ops` is unused in the diff and repo listing.\n\n## Blocking\n\nNone declared under gate enums (no scoring-row expiry, overflow, or cross-cycle poison **measured** in this fixture).\n\n## Recommendation\n\nGuard or document empty `netuids`, add a test that repeats the same list (and optional `clear_memo_for_tests()`), drop or test `scan_loop_ops`, then re-run gate.",
